        4 * Real.pi * R * ‖ξ - η‖ := by
    filter_upwards [Lp.coeFn_sub (S (lp.single 2 i 1)) (S (lp.single 2 j 1)),
      hS i, hS j, ae_restrict_mem hΩ] with x hsub hi hj hx
